    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d93">

                <pb facs="0089" n="69" sameAs="frus:frus1864p3/pg69"/>

                <head>Mr. Dayton to Mr. Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 450.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-04-14"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 14, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I herewith enclose to you a number of
                    slips, cut from Galignani of the 12th, 13th and 14th of this month, in reference
                    to the Archduke Maximilian, and his acceptance of the throne of Mexico, which I
                    have thought might be interesting to you.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WM. L. DAYTON.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, &amp;c., &amp;c.,
                        &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d93-a1.xml" xpointer="d93-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
